Z||000000||Hank is Here||08-08-2001||07:34 AM||||Rodney, <BR>I was thinking of a really simple and cheap product for you to produce.  A post-it type of sticker to cover the vin tags for the 87-88 Fiero.  This would be for someone doing a repaint, rather than masking them off just put the exact size post it over and nothing to worry about, no tape goo left over, would take no time at all to apply and take off.  So what do yall think?<P>Hank<BR>(still across the deep blue Atlantic with no Fiero  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> )||||reg||1
